From: Eduardo Ruiz <335073+eduarbo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 18:05:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Suggest a favorite's video on a system never played and move
 on when it ends

On a system with no game played, {system:continue} is now a suggestion: a random
favorite with a preview video, each favorite once before any repeats (a new
round never starts with the one just shown); without favorites, one of the 12
best-rated games with a video. Without any, it stays the best-rated favorite.

A system view <video> bound to {system:continue:video} plays the suggestion once:
when it ends the view moves on to the next suggestion and binds the panel again,
so its title, capture and X follow the video. The video of a game played last
loops as before. Videos stop on their own when a game starts or the screen saver
dims the screen.
